[00:22.57]
[00:22.57]Isn't it so incredible
[00:27.10]这难道不令人难以置信吗
[00:27.10]We're here sharing the same time and space
[00:33.06]我们此刻共享着同一时空
[00:33.06]In your eyes the sparks look like
[00:37.71]你们眼中的火花看起来像
[00:37.71]Thousands of bright stars I have gazed at for thousands of time
[00:44.15]我凝望了数千次的数千颗璀璨的星星
[00:44.15]May all your sweet dreams take flight
[00:46.84]愿你们所有的美梦都能展翅翱翔
[00:46.84]With the truth to be your guiding light
[00:49.17]让真理成为你们的指路明灯
[00:49.17]Let your curiosity set your spirit free and wild like fire
[00:54.88]让你们的好奇心释放你们的灵魂，像火一样自由奔放
[00:54.88]If the lonely nights are price to see
[00:57.34]如果孤独的夜晚
[00:57.34]Our dreams glowing brightly
[00:59.40]是让我们的梦想熠熠生辉的代价
